      using the exponents from J. Chem. Theory Comput., 7, 33-43 (2011)

NOTE: For the correlation part we extrapolate based on the scheme proposed
        in J. Chem. Phys. 1997, 106, 9639
      using the exponents from J. Chem. Theory Comput., 7, 33-43 (2011)


